1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:04,055
Watch. I need this ingredient in the fridge.

2
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:09,389
I have this beautiful turkey that I saved for Thanksgiving. And I'm going to

3
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:14,675
show you how to debone this turkey in eighteen seconds or less. Don't blink.

4
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,205
If you blink, I finished the turkey already,

5
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:20,280
okay? Because this is going to go well with the stuffing and cranberry sauce,

6
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:23,864
okay? Here, I have a beautiful turkey.

7
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:30,596
And this turkey is so huge, and it's so tense, you cannot cut through, even with a sharp knife. So, you've got to learn the

8
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:35,875
Chinese secret, which I learned from an elderly man in Chongqing, Sichuan.

9
00:00:38,120 --> 00:00:46,247
He said, "First, relax the turkey." Of course he's nervous—it's Thanksgiving! Everybody's coming over for dinner, and he's the main course!

10
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:52,096
You use only three fingers. You go up and down, up and down, circular motion.

11
00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:56,671
Only up and down. Don't waste time going sideways. Save your energy for the dishes.

12
00:00:56,760 --> 00:01:01,308
Circular motion. And then you wing it, okay? You wing it.

13
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:02,294
And you know what?

14
00:01:02,360 --> 00:01:06,065
The turkey is totally relaxed. Look at this.

15
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:09,535
Nervous. Relaxed. Ready for Thanksgiving.

16
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:12,752
Now, pay attention. Eighteen seconds. Time it,

17
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:20,185
okay? Three, two, one! One cut. Another cut. Turn it around. One cut along the back. Hold it like this. Don't do it like that.

18
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:27,685
The whole turkey breast comes out, and the tenderloin comes out like this. The tenderloin on this side comes out like that. Please, come out!

19
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:37,136
And turn it around. This side. The turkey breast comes out like this. Another piece of turkey breast comes out like that. And the last little tenderloin comes out like that.

20
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:39,535
Nice and done. Happy Thanksgiving!
